    "sections": {
        "description": "HI25 is the 2025 edition of a yearly series of personal blog themes by Henrique Iamarino, a theme designer at Automattic. Launched in 2026, it frames your writing with bold cards, Manrope type and a choice of accent palettes, plus templates for book reviews and showcases and a full-screen menu overlay. A new edition arrives on WordPress.org every year. If you’re a creative person, use it to blog more, share your process and passions, and make sharing a regular part of your routine."
